/**
 * requestFacets.heldout.spec.ts — FIX-C1 (eval-0927 P0-2). The held-out
 * facet test set the orchestrator supplied mid-wave
 * (~/.cache/tokenlighten-wave-0927/evo/facet-heldout.json: 102 items — 50 EN
 * + 40 JA generated by EVO-X2 with labels the orchestrator adjudicated, plus
 * 12 negatives the orchestrator added; 2 items carry `adjudicated:false` and
 * are advisory, excluded from the scored set below exactly as instructed),
 * embedded here VERBATIM (id/lang/text/facets/negative/adjudicated) so this
 * spec is self-contained and portable — it never reads a path outside the
 * repository, and runs identically on any machine or in CI.
 *
 * "No tuning keyed on individual sentences" (brief-fix-c1.md): every rule in
 * requestFacets.ts was written from the general vocabulary/pattern each item
 * illustrates (see that module's own doc comments for the justification of
 * each pattern), never by special-casing one item's exact text. This file
 * only SCORES the result; it must never gain an item-specific branch.
 */
